WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.622
This is how a clinical guideline enters BinPar:

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:09.967
from the moment the document is uploaded
until the chat can cite it, with human

00:00:10.007 --> 00:00:11.696
review before publishing.

00:00:12.931 --> 00:00:15.102
A PDF is not usable as it is.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:19.262
The chat needs the content organised
by specialty, with each figure linked

00:00:19.302 --> 00:00:20.880
to its source page.

00:00:21.172 --> 00:00:25.040
Ingestion makes that conversion, and
publishes nothing a person

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.280
has not reviewed.

00:00:26.979 --> 00:00:30.576
Knowledge is divided among the
committee's specialties.

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:33.335
Each has its own corpus,
made of units:

00:00:33.683 --> 00:00:35.125
short blocks with their exact citation.

00:00:35.165 --> 00:00:37.087
And it is organised in layers:

00:00:37.127 --> 00:00:41.773
the common base, each organisation's
and each centre's, which adds, corrects

00:00:41.813 --> 00:00:43.427
or withdraws what it inherits.

00:00:44.725 --> 00:00:48.629
In the back office, the document is uploaded,
the target layer is chosen and, if

00:00:48.669 --> 00:00:50.802
it is a new edition, which one it replaces.

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:53.636
A repeated file is recognised
by its fingerprint.

00:00:54.206 --> 00:00:57.925
The document is read twice: through its text
layer and through the image of each

00:00:57.965 --> 00:01:02.370
page. The two readings are compared, and
a person reviews the conversion

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:03.610
before moving on.

00:01:05.264 --> 00:01:08.175
No unit moves forward without
passing its checks.

00:01:08.541 --> 00:01:10.397
The citation must exist in the source.

00:01:10.764 --> 00:01:13.175
Every figure must appear
in the cited passage.

00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:15.138
No personal data may get in.

00:01:15.301 --> 00:01:18.749
And no unit may silently
contradict a higher layer.

00:01:19.338 --> 00:01:22.909
Before closing, every section of the source
ends up in a unit, or is discarded

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:24.193
with its reason in writing.

00:01:25.648 --> 00:01:29.930
On closing, each affected specialty
receives a proposal of changes.

00:01:30.407 --> 00:01:34.071
Clinical review compares each change
word by word, next to the passage

00:01:34.111 --> 00:01:36.800
that supports it, and either
includes it or discards it.

00:01:37.333 --> 00:01:40.041
Until someone approves and
publishes, nothing reaches the chat.

00:01:41.435 --> 00:01:45.710
On publishing, the layer's corpus is compiled
into a new version, and the

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:48.568
centres that depend on it
are updated automatically.

00:01:48.898 --> 00:01:52.809
A proposal left behind because its
base changed goes to reconciliation.

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:58.935
Each document stays in the library, with
its type, what it contributes and its use

00:01:58.975 --> 00:02:03.732
in the chat. If it is no longer current,
it is withdrawn layer by layer, also with

00:02:03.772 --> 00:02:04.972
review.

00:02:05.886 --> 00:02:09.606
To know whether everything is well covered,
each document has probes that check

00:02:09.646 --> 00:02:12.994
that its key data reach the corpus,
and a battery of two hundred and forty-

00:02:13.034 --> 00:02:16.939
six questions is
run from the back office.

00:02:16.979 --> 00:02:20.458
On reviewing its failures, none
was a loss in ingestion:

00:02:20.498 --> 00:02:23.242
almost all were due to content
that was not in the sources.

00:02:23.701 --> 00:02:27.717
Better coverage means completing the
library, and every new source enters

00:02:27.757 --> 00:02:29.038
by this same path.
